Package: bekkpub
Type: Package
Title: BEKK Covariance Models and Publication Tables
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits full and diagonal BEKK(1,1) multivariate volatility models
    by Gaussian quasi-maximum likelihood. Provides sandwich inference,
    residual diagnostics, simulation, and HTML and LaTeX publication tables.
